OL,5,CPAKISTANFBritish passport
OL,6, Fholder reported dead..........103B203
OL,7,FPlane "was not stormed",
OL,8,F says Pakistani official.......105B205
OL,9,FBritons talk about ordeal......104B204
OL,11,CTURKEYFMoslem extremists say
OL,12,F they attacked synagogue.......115B215
